  "content": "<h3><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><img src=\"https://s3.bmp.ovh/imgs/2024/08/25/4fdac10c65969386.png\" alt=\"\"></span></h3><h3><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\">此模組為&nbsp;<a style=\"color:#c2e0f4\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/kinetic-pixel\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Firearms-Kinetic Pixel</a> 新增方塊、材料與合成配方。</span></h3><h2><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong>你需要安裝以下內容：</strong></span></h2><h3><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><a style=\"color:#e03e2d\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/kinetic-pixel\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Firearms-Kinetic Pixel</a></span></h3><h3><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><a style=\"color:#e03e2d\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Geckolib</a></span></h3><h3><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><a style=\"color:#e03e2d\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a></span></h3><h3><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><a style=\"color:#e03e2d\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vics-point-blank\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Vic's Point Blank</a></span></h3><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">使用 Jei 顯示合成配方</span></h3><p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><img src=\"https://s3.bmp.ovh/imgs/2024/08/24/6b5c773d41c63921.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"365\" height=\"192\"><img src=\"https://s3.bmp.ovh/imgs/2024/08/24/e0296d1d35c4d1bb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"381\" height=\"192\"></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><img src=\"https://s3.bmp.ovh/imgs/2024/05/31/0b2bfa39778550a3.png\" alt=\"\"></span></p><h3><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">槍械工作台：</span>工作台需透過管道輸入<strong>岩漿</strong>才能運作。每製作一把槍械會消耗 250mB 岩漿。工作台本身可儲存 200mB 岩漿。玩家只需手持藍圖右鍵點擊工作台，用<strong>紅石</strong>啟動工作台即可製作槍械。</h3><h3><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">灰色棉花：&nbsp;</span>灰色棉花種子可透過採集野生灰色棉花獲得。野生灰色棉花生長於<strong>莽原</strong>生態域。灰色棉花可於室外或亮度大於<strong>7</strong>的室內生長，需種植在<strong>粗泥</strong>上。</h3><h3><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">藍圖： </span>壓力驅動槍械藍圖可與<strong>製圖師</strong>（學徒等級）交易獲得。熱能驅動槍械藍圖可與<strong>製圖師</strong>（大師等級）交易獲得。&nbsp;</h3><h3>上述兩種藍圖及實驗室槍械藍圖可在叢林神廟、掠奪者前哨站、沉船、村莊、林地府邸的<strong>儲物箱</strong>中找到。</h3><h3><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">零件模板： </span>可與<strong>流浪商人</strong>交易，或在叢林神廟、掠奪者前哨站、沉船、村莊、林地府邸的<strong>儲物箱</strong>中找到。</h3><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/M0plnQt5E9I\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p><img src=\"https://s3.bmp.ovh/imgs/2024/05/31/32a71eff642ecc76.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
